   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Ask: built yet, or proposal? Launch date?\n\u2022 K-12: attacker often has a real account\n\u2022 Authorization by relationship + tenant\n\u2022 Support/admin tools are attack surface\n\u2022 Top 3 before launch, the rest follow-ups\n\u2022 Make the safe path the easy path",
   "originalText": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Ask: built yet, or proposal? Launch date?\n\u2022 K-12: attacker often has a real account\n\u2022 Authorization by relationship + tenant\n\u2022 Support/admin tools are attack surface\n\u2022 Top 3 before launch, the rest follow-ups\n\u2022 Make the safe path the easy path",
